; Rescued, not a starter: the Court's second chapter wizard, freed by tracing the door he sketched in charcoal on the
; Gallery's end wall, dot to dot (.ai/chapter-wizards.md 4.8). The boy of the Chinese tale whose brush made real
; whatever he painted, kept here to paint the dark wizard's portraits. His passive is Paint What Is Needed, the one
; axis no other wizard owns: once a run, below a quarter of his health, a flask is painted at his feet. He opens on
; the Familiar (Arcane), choosing its form on his run's first screen (Node2DGame.OpeningForm.cs); only the crow has a
; final form (The Painted Door). Arcane is shared with the Archmage and the Sibyl on other spells (R1).
